        <div class="eyebrow">Phase 8 · replay, integrity, comparison and citation</div>
        <h1>EVIDENCE ARCHIVE & VERIFICATION.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Replay approved public web captures, compare recorded source changes, verify file hashes and export citations tied to preserved evidence.</p>
        <p class="card"><strong>Evidence boundary:</strong> A preserved capture proves what an approved public URL returned at the recorded time. It does not authenticate every statement, establish intent, remove legal context or convert allegations into proven wrongdoing.</p>
      </section>
      <section class="section wrap phase8-grid">
        <aside class="card">
          <label>Find an archive<input id="archive-search" type="search" reader field="Source, lane, date or SHA-256" /></label>
          <div id="archive-list" class="archive-list"><p>Loading archive manifest…</p></div>
        </aside>
        <div>
          <article class="card">
            <span id="archive-status-label" class="label">NO ARCHIVE SELECTED</span>
            <h2 id="archive-title">Choose a preserved capture</h2>
            <p id="archive-meta"></p>
            <p><strong>SHA-256:</strong> <code id="archive-hash" class="hash">—</code></p>
            <p><strong>Established:</strong> <span id="archive-established">—</span></p>
            <p><strong>Not established:</strong> <span id="archive-not-established">—</span></p>
            <div class="control-row"><a id="archive-live" class="btn alt" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open live source</a><button id="archive-verify" class="btn" type="button">Verify archive hash</button><button id="archive-cite" class="btn alt" type="button">Create citation</button></div>
            <p id="archive-verification-status" class="figure-caption">Select a capture to begin.</p>
          </article>
          <div id="archive-stage" class="archive-stage"><p style="padding:1rem">No replayable WACZ capture is selected.</p></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="section wrap">
        <article class="card verification-box">
          <div class="eyebrow">Signed publication chain</div><h2>INTEGRITY MANIFEST</h2>
          <p id="integrity-summary">Loading signed-manifest status…</p>
          <div class="control-row"><a  class="btn alt machine-data-link internal-only" href="data/evidence-integrity-manifest.json">Machine-readable data</a><button id="sigstore-bundle-link" class="btn alt" type="button" disabled>Sigstore bundle pending</button><button id="copy-verify-command" class="btn" type="button">Copy Cosign verification command</button></div>
          <p class="figure-caption">Integrity verification establishes that published bytes match the signed manifest. It does not establish the truth of every statement inside a source or archive.</p>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section class="section wrap" id="source-change-diff">
        <article class="card diff-box">
          <div class="eyebrow">Visual canonical-text comparison</div><h2>SOURCE CHANGE DIFF</h2>
          <div class="control-row"><select id="change-select"><option value="">Choose a recorded change</option></select><select id="diff-mode"><option value="words">Word comparison</option><option value="lines">Line comparison</option></select></div>
          <p id="diff-boundary" class="figure-caption">Recorded additions and removals are transparency observations, not automatic proof of concealment or wrongdoing.</p>
          <div id="diff-output" class="diff-output">Choose a source-change record.</div>
        </article>
      </section>
      <section class="section wrap" id="citation-export">
        <article class="card citation-box">
          <div class="eyebrow">Citation.js bibliography output</div><h2>CITATION EXPORT</h2>
